@startuml Sequence_Submit
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 200

title Sequence Diagram: Luong nop bai chinh thuc (Submit)

actor "Browser" as B
participant "Nginx\n:80" as Nginx
participant "Django Site\n(uWSGI :8000)" as Site
database "MariaDB" as DB
participant "Bridge\n:9998" as Bridge
participant "Judge Server\n:9999" as Judge
participant "WSEvent\n(Node.js)" as WS

== 1. User nop bai ==
B -> Nginx : POST /problem/<code>/submit\n{source, language}
Nginx -> Site : uWSGI proxy

== 2. Xu ly tai Site ==
Site -> DB : INSERT Submission\n(status='QU')
Site -> DB : INSERT SubmissionSource\n(source code)
Site -> Bridge : TCP :9998\n**submission-request**\n{submission-id, problem-id,\nlanguage, source}

== 3. Bridge nhan va chuyen den Judge ==
Bridge --> Site : submission-received\n{id}
Bridge -> Judge : TCP :9999\nJSON + Zlib + 4-byte header\n{submission-request packet}

== 4. Judge bien dich va chay ==
Judge -> Judge : Bien dich source code
alt Compile Error
  Judge --> Bridge : **compile-error**\n{log}
  Bridge -> DB : UPDATE Submission\nstatus='CE', error=log
  Bridge -> WS : POST :15101\nevent to sub_<id_secret>
  WS -> B : WebSocket :15100\n{type: compile-error}
else Compile OK
  Judge --> Bridge : **submission-processing**
  Bridge -> DB : UPDATE status='P'\nassign judged_on

  Judge --> Bridge : **grading-begin**\n{pretests_only}
  Bridge -> DB : UPDATE status='G'\nDELETE old SubmissionTestCase

  loop Moi test case
    Judge -> Judge : Chay code voi\nresource limits\n(time, memory, output)
    Judge --> Bridge : **test-case-status**\n{case, status, time,\nmemory, points, total}
    Bridge -> DB : INSERT SubmissionTestCase
    Bridge -> WS : POST :15101\n{type: test-case, ...}
    WS -> B : WebSocket\n{case result}
    note right of B : UI cap nhat\ntung test case\nrealtime
  end

  Judge --> Bridge : **grading-end**\n{cases passed/total}

  == 5. Bridge tinh diem va luu ket qua ==
  Bridge -> DB : UPDATE Submission\nstatus='D', result='AC/WA/...'\npoints, case_points, case_total
  Bridge -> DB : UPDATE Problem stats\n(user_count, ac_rate)
  Bridge -> DB : UPDATE Profile points

  Bridge -> WS : POST :15101\nevent sub_<id_secret>\n{type: grading-end, result}
  WS -> B : WebSocket\n{final result}
end

note right of B
  Browser hien thi ket qua
  **khong can reload trang**
end note

@enduml
